3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,800
Haa, cuba tengok ni!

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,000
Dalam Pahlawan Angka, anak jadi hero,

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,800
