16
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,900
Nak main game? Mainlah.

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,900
Kali ni, biar Matematik pun ikut sekali!

18
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,800
Pahlawan Angka. Jom selamatkan semua teman sambil belajar!
